WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.390
Vidiyo a na-akọwa otu esi eji Arclight mee ihe ngosi red reflex site n'ịhọrọ ntọala ọkụ kacha na-egbuke egbuke.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.650
Jide n'aka na oghere oghere dị n'elu, ebe enweghị ike oghere na oghere anya.

3
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.010
N'ogologo ogwe aka, lelee reflex na anya abụọ n'otu oge.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.750
Tulee nchapụta na agba n'etiti anya abụọ.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.290
Na nyocha nkịtị, ekwesighi inwe ọdịiche zuru oke na nchapụta na agba n'etiti anya abụọ.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.120
N'ime ụmụ ọhụrụ ọcha na ndị Eshia, reflex nwere ike ịdị ka oroma na odo.

7
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.500
Ọdịiche ndị a ka na-adịkwa mma n'ihi na agba na nchapụta niile bụ otu n'etiti anya abụọ.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.980
Ntugharị na-adịghị mma bụ mgbe enwere ezigbo ọdịiche na nchapụta na agba n'etiti anya abụọ.

9
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:10.890
Nke a nwere ike ịbụ nlegharị anya corneal chụpụrụ, ihe nkedo gbara ọchịchịrị dị n'ime ntugharị anya nke otu anya ma ọ bụ anya abụọ, ma ọ bụ ntugharị uhie na-adịghị kpamkpam.

10
00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:25.670
Nnwale reflex na-adịghị mma nwere ike igosi ọnụnọ cataract, retinoblastoma, scarneal, squint, ma ọ bụ njehie refractive.

11
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.970
Ihe ndị a niile chọrọ nyocha ọzọ site n'aka ọkachamara.
